    "description": "Nankai Chemical Company,Limited manufacturers and sells chemical in Japan and internationally. The company offers inorganic industrial chemicals, water treatment disinfectants, water treatment agents, healthy foods, sulfuric acid recycling, and pesticides, as well as salt. It is also involved in the manufacturing and distribution of chemical industry products, pharmaceuticals, pesticides, cosmetics, quasi-drugs, and food additives; development and analysis of chemical industry products, pharmaceuticals, pesticides, cosmetics, quasi-drugs, foods and food additives; collection, transportation, and intermediate treatment of industrial waste; manufacturing, processing, and distribution of salt; distribution and recovery of precious metals, non-ferrous metals, and other bullions and their salts; distribution of precision machinery, textile machinery, plating equipment, paint equipment, and building materials; import/export of technologies and products; equipment engineering and management maintenance business; parking lot, and real estate management and warehousing; and consignment and agency services of accounting, general affairs, and personnel affairs research, development, production, and sale of agricultural, livestock, and marine products; freight transport and handling; calibration; management and operation of power generation; and electricity supply and sales business. Nankai Chemical Company,Limited was founded in 1906 and is headquartered in Osaka, Japan."
